# ProjectOrganoid

Survival Horror / Tactical Action RPG (Resident Evil × Parasite Eve). Avery Vance in the Epitope Subterranean Complex (BSL-4 lockdown). UE5 C++ + Blueprints; Enhanced Input.

## Naming
`AProjectOrganoidCharacter`, `AProjectOrganoidGameMode`, `UProjectOrganoidAnimInstance`. C++ lives in `Source/ProjectOrganoid/`.

## When editing .h / .cpp
- Follow UE5 include order; `*.generated.h` last.
- Expose designer/UMG gameplay props via `UPROPERTY` / `UFUNCTION` with clear Categories (`Vitals`, `Tactical`, `Inventory`, `Weapons`, `PE`).

## Systems to build toward
Diegetic vitals (BPM, Toxicity, Health, PE). Tactical Mode (0.2 dilation, 800uu sphere, weak-point targeting). Grid inventory. Ballistics weapons (P226, M4 Shotgun, Cryo Lancer, Denaturing Launcher). SOT progression at Sterling terminals. Five subterranean facility levels (Admin → Reactor).

Full detail: `.cursor/rules/project-organoid-core.mdc` and `ue5-cpp-gameplay.mdc`.
